n-2026-09", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "end": 180, "src": "W", "drop": [[6, 78]], "start": 0}, {"n": 1, "end": 256, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 181}, {"n": 1, "end": 1273, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 1208}, {"n": 1, "end": 1502, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 1379}, {"n": 1, "end": 1607, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 1503}, {"n": 1, "end": 1748, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 1608}, {"n": 1, "end": 3132, "src": "W", "drop": [], "start": 2906}], "attribution": {"url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Glevum&oldid=1356203669", "title": "Glevum", "changes": "sentences selected and shortened", "licence_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"}, "desc_sha256": "146e8b3801cdb0e0ad80c539a1e2733ce683dfdb4fde60d0334f315ff1498806"}}'' restored on Glevum', '146e8b3801cdb0e0ad80c539a1e2733ce683dfdb4fde60d0334f315ff1498806', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-pilot2-2026-10-19: writer card_writer:teaser-rewrite-v-001", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot2-2026-10-19/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Retired Roman soldiers were given farmland around this town. The town rose inside the old fort, kept the fort''s street plan and ramparts, and gained fine homes with mosaic floors."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-pilot2-2026-10-19: checker card_fact_checker:teaser-check-v-002 (check-v), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot2-2026-10-19/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "retired Roman soldiers (legionaries) settled the town [S1]; they were given farmland in the surrounding district [S4]; the town was built inside the old (legionary) fort [S1, S5]; the town kept the fort''s street plan [S5]; the town kept the fort''s ramparts [S5]; fine homes with mosaic floors were built in the town [S6]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-shorts-pilot2-2026-10-19: verifier card_web_verifier:teaser-verify2-002 (verify2), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot2-2026-10-19/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "This town (Glevum) was a settlement of retired Roman soldiers (a colonia for veterans). [SUPPORTED: https://nora.nerc.ac.uk/id/eprint/8889/1/Chenery%20et%20al.%202010%20Roman%20Gloucester%20Isotopes.pdf]; The retired soldiers were given farmland around the town. [SUPPORTED: https://d2eq6t2r9q1quu.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/cms/5/5.6a_The_Romans_in_Gloucester.pdf]; There was an older fort on the site before the town. [SUPPORTED: https://nora.nerc.ac.uk/id/eprint/8889/1/Chenery%20et%20al.%202010%20Roman%20Gloucester%20Isotopes.pdf]; The town rose inside the old fort. [SUPPORTED: https://www.encyclopedia.com/places/united-states-and-canada/us-political-geography/gloucester]; The town kept the fort''s street plan. [SUPPORTED: https://d2eq6t2r9q1quu.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/cms/5/5.6a_The_Romans_in_Gloucester.pdf]; The town kept the fort''s ramparts. [SUPPORTED: https://www.encyclopedia.com/places/united-states-and-canada/us-political-geography/gloucester]; The town gained fine homes. [SUPPORTED: https://www.roman-britain.co.uk/places/glevum/]; Those homes had mosaic floors. [SUPPORTED: https://www.roman-britain.co.uk/places/glevum/]"}]'::jsonb),
