: verifier card_web_verifier:teaser-verify2-002 (verify2), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-shorts-pilot2-2026-10-19/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "A cult statue by Endoeus once stood in this sanctuary (of Athena Alea at Tegea). [SUPPORTED: https://www.theoi.com/Text/Pausanias8C.html]; The cult statue was made of ivory. [SUPPORTED: https://www.theoi.com/Text/Pausanias8C.html]; The statue stood in the sanctuary only once, i.e. it is no longer there (it was removed). [SUPPORTED: https://www.theoi.com/Text/Pausanias8C.html]; The sanctuary had a temple of the Geometric period. [SUPPORTED: https://chronique.efa.gr/?r=report&id=13594]; Slag was found in front of the Geometric temple. [SUPPORTED: https://chronique.efa.gr/?r=report&id=13593]; Tests (analyses) were carried out on that slag. [SUPPORTED: https://chronique.efa.gr/?r=report&id=13593]; The tests confirmed that metal was worked in the sanctuary. [SUPPORTED: https://chronique.efa.gr/?r=report&id=13736]; The metalworking dates to the time of the Geometric temple. [SUPPORTED: https://chronique.efa.gr/?r=report&id=13593]"}, {"source": "web fact W1", "url": "https://chronique.efa.gr/?r=report&id=13593", "quote": "Les analyses de scories recueillies devant le temple géométrique ont confirmé l''existence d''activités métallurgiques dans le sanctuaire à cette époque."}]'::jsonb),
